/* Fictional, article-specific Napoli and Leverkusen reactions; no autogenerated comments. */
(()=>{window.NAPOLI_CURATED_ARCHIVE={...(window.NAPOLI_CURATED_ARCHIVE||{}),...{'leverkusen-92-sep-2028':[{"user":"CurvaB","lang":"it","text":"TRE A UNO. POI TRE A TRE. AL NOVANTADUESIMO. HO PERSO LA VOCE.","replies":[{"user":"NapoliTherapy","lang":"en","text":"I have also lost the ability to feel my hands."},{"user":"CurvaB","lang":"it","text":"Ma quanto è bello questo sport quando non ci uccide?"}]},{"user":"BeierHive","lang":"en","text":"Two goals AND the assist to Pio. I want a separate statue for every contribution.","replies":[{"user":"PioNation","lang":"en","text":"Give him one statue and put Pio beside it. Fair compromise."}]},{"user":"SaladinoOutNow","lang":"en","text":"Three conceded at home. Everybody celebrating is missing the point.","replies":[{"user":"CurvaCalculator","lang":"en","text":"I agree about the defence, not the implied dismissal letter."},{"user":"SaladinoOutNow","lang":"en","text":"The letter is already formatted."}]},{"user":"MeretUnion","lang":"en","text":"He made saves when we were being battered early. He also has to catch that ball. Both facts exist.","replies":[{"user":"BastoniAgenda","lang":"en","text":"That's the most reasonable post I've seen from this account."}]},{"user":"NapoliDoomer","lang":"en","text":"At 3–1 I deleted the app. At 3–3 I reinstalled it. I need help.","replies":[{"user":"NapoliTherapy","lang":"en","text":"You do this every European night."},{"user":"NapoliDoomer","lang":"en","text":"The app keeps accepting me back."}]},{"user":"PioNation","lang":"it","text":"PIO ENTRA, PIO SEGNA. QUESTO RAGAZZO NON ASPETTA IL PERMESSO.","replies":[{"user":"BeierHive","lang":"en","text":"And Beier gave him the ball. Partnership, not rivalry."}]},{"user":"TacticalNonno","lang":"it","text":"La rimonta è magnifica. Però tre gol subiti in casa non si cancellano.","replies":[{"user":"CurvaB","lang":"en","text":"Nonno, lasciaci festeggiare almeno dieci minuti."}]},{"user":"PazEnjoyer","lang":"en","text":"The Paz ball for Beier at 39 was the calmest thing in an utterly chaotic match.","replies":[{"user":"SouthStandAnalyst","lang":"en","text":"Without it we're chasing for far longer. Huge moment."}]},{"user":"McTominayMinutes","lang":"en","text":"A 92nd-minute assist from McTominay. That final pass deserves its own headline.","replies":[{"user":"BeierHive","lang":"en","text":"Pass deserves the credit; finish deserves the screaming."}]},{"user":"NevesNation","lang":"en","text":"Neves wins it back late. McTominay gets the assist. The whole midfield stayed alive.","replies":[{"user":"TacticalNonno","lang":"en","text":"Yes. Do not mix an interception up with a credited assist."}]},{"user":"OliseWatch","lang":"en","text":"Hit the post and I thought THAT was our moment. Apparently we needed the full dramatic ending.","replies":[{"user":"NapoliTherapy","lang":"en","text":"This club forbids straightforward joy."}]},{"user":"CurvaCalculator","lang":"en","text":"Four UCL points after two. My spreadsheet says fine; my heartbeat disagrees.","replies":[{"user":"SaladinoOutNow","lang":"en","text":"A spreadsheet cannot watch our defending."}]},{"user":"LeverkusenWerkself","lang":"en","text":"Up two with minutes left and we let Beier do THAT. Completely sickening.","replies":[{"user":"CurvaB","lang":"en","text":"Ci vediamo, amici. Respect for the fight."}],"visitorClub":"BAYER LEVERKUSEN"},{"user":"BastoniAgenda","lang":"en","text":"Three conceded means the entire defensive unit gets questions, not just a goalkeeper meme.","replies":[{"user":"MeretUnion","lang":"en","text":"Thank you. Criticism should be shared honestly."}]},{"user":"AwayDayNapoli","lang":"en","text":"I thought we were finished on 3–1. Then Pio gave the whole ground permission to believe.","replies":[{"user":"PioHaterForNoReason","lang":"en","text":"Could have scored two and saved us the stress."},{"user":"PioNation","lang":"en","text":"Somehow you always find a complaint."}]},{"user":"PioHaterForNoReason","lang":"en","text":"Scoring in the 86th is very late. Please improve punctuality.","replies":[{"user":"PioNation","lang":"en","text":"The equaliser was even later. You must be furious."}]},{"user":"BeierHive","lang":"de","text":"Zwei Tore, eine Vorlage. Was für ein Abend für Beier!","replies":[{"user":"CurvaB","lang":"en","text":"Non so il tedesco ma concordo con tutto."}]},{"user":"MeretUnion","lang":"it","text":"Alex ci ha tenuti vivi all'inizio, ma quella respinta è un errore grosso.","replies":[{"user":"NapoliTherapy","lang":"en","text":"Good saves are not a coupon that pays for a bad punch."}]},{"user":"SouthStandAnalyst","lang":"en","text":"The equaliser was incredible. The second-half crossbar and Mateta goal tell us why it was necessary.","replies":[{"user":"TacticalNonno","lang":"en","text":"Exactamente. Watch the entire match, not just the clip."}]},{"user":"CurvaB","lang":"nap","text":"Maronna mia, 'stu Napoli me fa ascì pazzo!","replies":[{"user":"NapoliDoomer","lang":"en","text":"Translation: all of us, every week."}]},{"user":"LeverkusenNorth","lang":"en","text":"Still can't believe we got a point after being 3–1 up. Beier used to be the least of my concerns.","replies":[{"user":"LeverkusenWerkself","lang":"en","text":"The whole last ten minutes is a nightmare."},{"user":"BeierHive","lang":"en","text":"He became everyone's concern at 90+2."}],"visitorClub":"BAYER LEVERKUSEN"},{"user":"OneNilEnjoyer","lang":"en","text":"I requested a boring 1–0. The club responded with SIX goals.","replies":[{"user":"NapoliTherapy","lang":"en","text":"Your request has been escalated to the wrong department."}]},{"user":"KDBVision","lang":"en","text":"Paz's pass at 39 is the kind of quality that keeps you in a match even when you're second best.","replies":[{"user":"PazEnjoyer","lang":"en","text":"And he's just getting started in this role."}]},{"user":"BastoniAgenda","lang":"it","text":"La difesa deve parlarne domani. Stanotte però applaudiamo chi non ha mollato.","replies":[{"user":"CurvaB","lang":"en","text":"Finalmente siamo d'accordo su tutto."}]},{"user":"EuropeanNights","lang":"en","text":"This is the kind of draw that feels like winning until you remember the group table.","replies":[{"user":"CurvaCalculator","lang":"en","text":"One point is still one point. Both emotions are justified."}]},{"user":"NapoliTherapy","lang":"en","text":"I'm happy, angry, exhausted and somehow ready to watch it again.","replies":[{"user":"NapoliDoomer","lang":"en","text":"I can't watch the Meret punch again."}]},{"user":"DaviesExpress","lang":"en","text":"The right side and left side kept trying, but when Beier gets that half-yard everything changes.","replies":[{"user":"OliseWatch","lang":"en","text":"I wanted Olise's post shot to go in. Painful margins."}]},{"user":"PioNation","lang":"en","text":"Pio comes off the bench and scores the goal that makes 90+2 possible. Never erase that part.","replies":[{"user":"BeierHive","lang":"en","text":"No one should. Two finishers, one comeback."}]},{"user":"SaladinoOutNow","lang":"en","text":"Someone ask why it takes 86 minutes and a two-goal deficit to get the urgency level right.","replies":[{"user":"TacticalNonno","lang":"en","text":"That's a fair question. Your preferred solution is still absurd."}]},{"user":"NapoliDoomer","lang":"it","text":"A tre a uno avevo già scritto il necrologio. Scusate.","replies":[{"user":"CurvaB","lang":"en","text":"Conservalo per la prossima partita, se proprio devi."}]},{"user":"PartenopeiForever","lang":"en","text":"That sound when Beier made it 3–3 is why I will never give up on this club.","replies":[{"user":"AwayDayNapoli","lang":"en","text":"Nothing else feels like stoppage time at the Maradona."}]},{"user":"TacticalNonno","lang":"en","text":"Tomorrow: film room. Tonight: appreciate that McTominay kept his head for the final ball.","replies":[{"user":"McTominayMinutes","lang":"en","text":"Best combination of joy and responsibility in this thread."}]}]}};})();